    "created_at": "2017-03-28T21:38:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-28T21:38:14Z",
    "body": "Looks like srcset only looks for parens to account for possible future CSS functions?  Right now the only valid descriptors are 1w, 1x, and 1h.\r\n\r\nIf that's the case, then the algo is broken - it'll misparse at times once that starts being allowed.  It needs to track nesting, and you're making my point for me. ^_^",
